cl. 1. Ā. क॑ल्पते (Pāṇ. viii, 2, 18; perf. चकॢपे, 3. pl. चाकॢप्रे॑, RV. x, 130, 5 and 6; 2nd fut. कल्पिष्यते and कल्प्स्य्˚ [3. du. कल्प्स्येते, AitBr.; vv.ll. कॢप्स्˚ and क्लप्स्˚], or कल्प्स्यति; Cond. अकल्पिष्यत, or ˚ल्प्स्यत्; 1st fut. कल्पिता or कल्प्ता [see Pāṇ. vii, 2, 60]; aor. अकॢप्त or ˚पत्; pr. and perf. only Ā. Pāṇ. i, 3, 91-93),
to be well ordered or regulated, be well managed, succeed, AV.; TS.; ŚBr. &c.;
to bear suitable relation to anything, correspond, be adapted to, in accordance with, suitable to (instr.), RV. i, 170, 2; AV. &c.;
to be fit for (loc.), R.;
to accommodate one's self to, be favourable to, subserve, effect (with dat.), VS.; ŚBr. xiv; AitBr.; Mn. &c.;
to partake of (dat.), KaṭhUp.; Mn.; Bhag. &c.;
to fall to the share, be shared or partaken by (loc. dat. or gen., e.g. यज्ञो॑ देवे॑षु कल्पताम्, ‘let the sacrifice be shared by the gods’, VS. xix, 45), VS.; AitBr.; ChUp.; MBh.;
to become (with nom.), RV. x, 130, 5 and 6; AV.; Bhaṭṭ.;
 (with dat. [Pāṇ. ii, 3, 13

] R.; Pañcat.);
to happen, occur, BhP. iii, 16, 12; Bhaṭṭ.;
to prepare, arrange, Bhaṭṭ. xiv, 89;
to produce, cause, effect, create (with acc.), BhP. iii, 7, 25; Bhaṭṭ.;
to declare as, consider as (with double acc.), Pañcat. (perf. p. कॢप्तवत्) :
Caus. P. Ā. कल्प॑यति, ˚ते, (aor. अचीकॢपत् or चाकॢपत् [AV. vi, 35, 3] Subj. चीकॢपाति, RV. x, 157, 2), to set in order, arrange, distribute, dispose, RV.; AV.; AitBr.;
to bring into suitable connection with, RV. x, 2, 4;
to prepare, arrange, RV.; AV.; ŚBr.; MBh. &c.;
to fit out, furnish with (instr.), TS. ii;
to help any one in obtaining anything (dat. or loc. or gen.), ŚvetUp.; MBh.; R. ii, 43, 19;
to fix, settle, Daś.;
to declare as, consider as (with double acc., e.g. मातरम् एनां कल्पयन्तु, ‘let them consider her as their mother’, Kum. vi, 80), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to make, execute, bring about, RV.; AV.; ŚBr.; MBh. &c.;
to frame, form, invent, compose (as a poem &c.), imagine, Mn. i, 102 &c.;
to perform (as a ceremony &c.), Lāṭy.;
to trim, cut, VarBṛS.;
 (in Prākṛt), Śak.;
to pronounce a formula or verse which contains the √ कॢप्, ŚBr. ix :
Desid. चिकॢप्सति or चिकल्पिषते, Pāṇ. i, 3, 92 and vii, 2, 60;
